[type     |-> "uniprocess", 
 name  |-> "A", 
 decls  |-> <<[var |-> "x", eqOrIn |-> "=", val |-> << "0" >>], 
              [var |-> "y", eqOrIn |-> "=", val |-> << "0" >>]>>,
 defs   |-> <<  >>,
 prcds  |-> <<>>,
 body  |-> <<[label |-> "L",
              stmts |-> <<[type |-> "when", 
                           exp |-> << "(col54) /\\", "TRUE"
, "(col0) /\\", "y", "=", "0" >>]>>], 
             [label |-> "E",
              stmts |-> <<[type |-> "skip"]>>]>>]